# Email agent

- Mailbox scope: **primary UPN only** (`MS_MAILBOX_UPN` in `.env`). No shared mailboxes in v1.
- Orchestration specs live in `orchestration/email-*.yaml`; specialists in `agents/specialists/email/`.
- **Never send email** or apply mailbox moves without explicit user approval in the session.
- Morning digest (`email-morning-digest.yaml`): read/analyze only—no organize, no mass draft.
- Outputs go to `data/runs/email/` (gitignored); do not commit message bodies or tokens.
- If Graph is not configured, use sample fixtures or pasted content; point user to `docs/email/IT_ADMIN_REQUEST.md`.
